@IpInformation.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5227

### Task 1: IP information (cache -> database -> IP2C)
GET {{IpInformation.Api_HostAddress}}/api/ip-information/8.8.8.8
Accept: application/json

### Task 1: private IP (IP2C answers XZ "IANA Special-Purpose Address")
GET {{IpInformation.Api_HostAddress}}/api/ip-information/10.0.0.1
Accept: application/json

### Task 1: invalid IP -> 400 ProblemDetails
GET {{IpInformation.Api_HostAddress}}/api/ip-information/256.1.1.1
Accept: application/json

### Task 3: report for all countries
GET {{IpInformation.Api_HostAddress}}/api/reports/countries
Accept: application/json

### Task 3: report for some countries
GET {{IpInformation.Api_HostAddress}}/api/reports/countries?twoLetterCodes=US&twoLetterCodes=gr
Accept: application/json

### Task 3: invalid code -> 400 ProblemDetails
GET {{IpInformation.Api_HostAddress}}/api/reports/countries?twoLetterCodes=USA
Accept: application/json

###
